                "a": "(i) (A ∪ B)' = A' ∩ B'\nL.H.S. = (A ∪ B)'\nA ∪ B = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} ∪ {2, 4, 6, 8, 10} = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8, 10}\n(A ∪ B)' = U − (A ∪ B) = {7, 9}\nR.H.S. = A' ∩ B'\nA' = U − A = {6, 7, 8, 9, 10}\nB' = U − B = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9}\nA' ∩ B' = {6, 7, 8, 9, 10} ∩ {1, 3, 5, 7, 9} = {7, 9}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S.\n(ii) (A ∩ B)' = A' ∪ B'\nL.H.S. = (A ∩ B)'\nA ∩ B = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5} ∩ {2, 4, 6, 8, 10} = {2, 4}\n(A ∩ B)' = U − (A ∩ B) = {1, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10}\nR.H.S. = A' ∪ B'\nA' = U − A = {6, 7, 8, 9, 10}\nB' = U − B = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9}\nA' ∪ B' = {6, 7, 8, 9, 10} ∪ {1, 3, 5, 7, 9} = {1, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S."
