                "q": "The diagram illustrates the number of litres of drinking water per family of 110 families in a certain plaza.\nLitres of drinking water used per family: 5-10, 10-15, 15-20, 20-25, 25-30, 30-35\nNumber of families: 5, 15, 25, 35, 20, 10\n(i) How many numbers of families used 25 to 30 numbers of litres of drinking water per family?\n(ii) How many numbers of families used 5 to 10 numbers of litres of drinking water per family?\n(iii) How many numbers of families used 15 to 20 numbers of litres of drinking water per family?\n(iv) How many litres of drinking water per family are used by maximum number of families?\n(v) How many litres of drinking water per family are used by minimum number of families?",
