                "a": "(i) P ∪ Q = Q ∪ P\nL.H.S. = P ∪ Q = {a, b, c, d, e} ∪ {a, e, i, o, u} = {a, b, c, d, e, i, o, u}\nR.H.S. = Q ∪ P = {a, e, i, o, u} ∪ {a, b, c, d, e} = {a, b, c, d, e, i, o, u}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S.\n(ii) P ∩ Q = Q ∩ P\nL.H.S. = P ∩ Q = {a, b, c, d, e} ∩ {a, e, i, o, u} = {a, e}\nR.H.S. = Q ∩ P = {a, e, i, o, u} ∩ {a, b, c, d, e} = {a, e}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S.\n(iii) P ∩ (Q ∩ R) = (P ∩ Q) ∩ R\nL.H.S. = P ∩ (Q ∩ R)\n= {a, b, c, d, e} ∩ ({a, e, i, o, u} ∩ {c, d, e, i})\n= {a, b, c, d, e} ∩ {e, i}\n= {e}\nR.H.S. = (P ∩ Q) ∩ R\n= ({a, b, c, d, e} ∩ {a, e, i, o, u}) ∩ {c, d, e, i}\n= {a, e} ∩ {c, d, e, i}\n= {e}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S.\n(iv) P ∪ (Q ∩ R) = (P ∪ Q) ∩ (P ∪ R)\nL.H.S. = P ∪ (Q ∩ R)\n= {a, b, c, d, e} ∪ ({a, e, i, o, u} ∩ {c, d, e, i})\n= {a, b, c, d, e} ∪ {e, i}\n= {a, b, c, d, e, i}\nR.H.S. = (P ∪ Q) ∩ (P ∪ R)\n= ({a, b, c, d, e} ∪ {a, e, i, o, u}) ∩ ({a, b, c, d, e} ∪ {c, d, e, i})\n= {a, b, c, d, e, i, o, u} ∩ {a, b, c, d, e, i}\n= {a, b, c, d, e, i}\nL.H.S. = R.H.S."
