                "q": "4. هيٺيان خال پريو.\n(i) Cosec 30° = ____\n(ii) Cot 60° = ____\n(iii) Cos 45° = ____\n(iv) Sec 30° = ____\n(v) Tan m∠C جو اُبتڙ = ____\n(vi) Sin m∠A = [[∠A جو سامهون وارو پاسو/____]]\n(vii) Cos (90° − m∠A) = Sin ____\n(viii) Tan 30° = Cot ____\n(ix) Cosec 10° = Sec ____\n(x) Sec (90° − θ) = Cosec ____",
                "a": "(i) Cosec 30° = 2\n(ii) Cot 60° = [[1/√3]]\n(iii) Cos 45° = [[1/√2]]\n(iv) Sec 30° = [[2/√3]]\n(v) Tan m∠C جو اُبتڙ = Cot m∠C\n(vi) Sin m∠A = [[∠A جو سامهون وارو پاسو/هيپاٽينوز]]\n(vii) Cos (90° − m∠A) = Sin m∠A\n(viii) Tan 30° = Cot (90° − 30°) = Cot 60°\n(ix) Cosec 10° = Sec (90° − 10°) = Sec 80°\n(x) Sec (90° − θ) = Cosec θ"
