                    "q": "Q7. What are the input and output devices? Give some examples.",
                    "a": "Input device: a device or component that provides information in different forms of energy, converts it to an electrical signal and forwards it to the computer. Examples: keyboard, mouse, digital camera, microphone, barcode reader. Output device: a device that is used to receive the data from the processor and shows its results. Examples: monitor, printer, speaker, headphone."
