                  {
                    "q": "What is a semiconductor? Give an example.",
                    "a": "A semiconductor is the element which acts sometimes as a conductor and sometimes as an insulator, depending on certain conditions. Silicon is an example of a semiconductor."
                  },
                  {
                    "q": "What are the basic components of an electronic system? Give examples of input, processor and output devices.",
                    "a": "The basic components of an electronic system are the input device, the processor and the output device. Input devices (keyboard, mouse, digital camera, microphone, barcode reader) provide information, convert it to an electrical signal and forward it to the computer. The processor (e.g. the computer's central processing unit) processes the information. Output devices (monitor, printer, speaker, headphone) receive the data from the processor and show its results."
                  }
